    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nūtrīcātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		nutrico, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a suckling, nursing</i> (ante- and post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">munus nutricationis grave ac difficile,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					12, 1, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puerorum nutricationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Dogm. Plat. 2, p. 27, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbarum,</span>”
				<i>a nourishing, rearing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 44, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
